Upstream-Name: swisswatch
Upstream-Contact: Barak A. Pearlmutter <barak.pearlmutter@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/barak/swisswatch
Comment:
 Swisswatch was written by Simon Leinen at EPFL in 1992 as an X Toolkit
 reimplementation of der Mouse's mclock, and first packaged for Debian
 by Karl Sackett in 1997.  As of version 0.7 (2026) it has been ported
 from X11/Xt to GTK4/Cairo and is maintained upstream by Barak A.
 Pearlmutter at https://github.com/barak/swisswatch.

